              "italic": false,
              "newline": true
            },
            {
              "text": "• This could be the start of a takeover (9/10 RB touches after Dobbins left).",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "newline": true
            },
            {
              "text": "• Dobbins injury prone, Harvey dealing with hamstring aswell. Awesome stash, bid depending on your RB depth",
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "newline": true
            }
