              "italic": false,
              "newline": true
            },
            {
              "text": "• Enough in between (17.5% TPRR, 7.9% 1stDRR to feel confident in his talent). Wouldn’t go nuts due to 2 big plays but I’m confident this is a real WR in the NFL just comes down to the upside",
